# *.tf files embed bash local-exec provisioner commands (infra/keycloak/terraform/keycloak.tf) --
# a CRLF checkout on Windows breaks those at runtime (found live: bash
# reads `\<CR><LF>` as NOT a line continuation, and even without
# continuations, embedded \r before a closing quote corrupts the command
# string). Force LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.tf text eol=lf
